Usage: deployment/native-packages/docker/prepare-builder-image.sh [options] <release|all>

Options:
  -f, --force     Force build without checking registry
  --no-cache      Build without using cache

Examples:
  deployment/native-packages/docker/prepare-builder-image.sh deb-resolute              # Prepare single image (pull or build)
  deployment/native-packages/docker/prepare-builder-image.sh all                    # Prepare all images
  deployment/native-packages/docker/prepare-builder-image.sh -f all                 # Force rebuild all images
  deployment/native-packages/docker/prepare-builder-image.sh -f --no-cache rpm-el9  # Force rebuild without cache

Available releases: deb-resolute deb-noble rpm-el9 rpm-el10
